Dear Robert,

Following the stripping of insulation on 4-RA-104 within the ATU-100, UT thickness gauging has confirmed external CUI wall loss below the t-min of 3.81 mm at two locations. These findings are detailed in the UT Thickness Report HIS-2010-0251.

As the readings have fallen below the retirement thickness, we have issued QSCP-NCR-2010-007. Please review the data for Robert Hendricks to determine the necessary repair scope or fitness-for-service assessment required to close this nonconformance.

